l":"/docs/components/date-picker#working-with-dates","content":"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives. Locale comes from a host `<I18nProvider>`. This version has no typed/segmented entry - selection is via the calendar."},"360":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-23","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#default","content":"A single date picker."},"361":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-24","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#range","content":"A start/end range picker."},"362":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-25","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#controlled","content":"Driving the value with `useState`."},"363":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-26","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#custom-format","content":"Controlling the label with `formatOptions`."},"364":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-27","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#min--max","content":"Bounding selectable dates with `minValue` / `maxValue`."},"365":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-28","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#error","content":"An invalid picker showing a validation message via `isInvalid` and `errorMessage`."},"366":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-29","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#disabled","content":"A disabled picker via `isDisabled`."},"367":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-30","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#customization","content":"`formatOptions` accepts any `Intl.DateTimeFormatOptions` (e.g. `{ dateStyle: 'short' }`, `{ month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }`). `placeholder` sets the empty-state text."},"368":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-31","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#accessibility","content":"The whole field is a single focusable button; Enter/Space opens the popover"},"369":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-32","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#accessibility","content":"Focus is trapped in the open popover and returns to the trigger on close"},"370":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-33","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#accessibility","content":"Esc and outside-click dismiss the popover"},"371":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-34","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#accessibility","content":"The calendar grid is fully keyboard navigable and screen-reader announced"},"372":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-35","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#best-practices","content":"Provide a `label` (or `aria-label`) on every picker."},"373":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-36","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#best-practices","content":"For typed/keyboard-fast date entry far from today, use the calendar's month dropdown and year input."},"374":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-37","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#troubleshooting","content":"Dates not localizing? Wrap the app in `<I18nProvider locale=\"…\">`."},"375":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-38","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#troubleshooting","content":"Form value missing on submit? Pass a `name` — React Aria renders the hidden input."},"376":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-39","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#props","content":"The `DatePicker` component accepts the following props:"},"377":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-40","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#props","content":"The `DateRangePicker` component accepts the following props:"},"378":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"page","content":"DropZone","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone"},"379":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-0","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone","content":"A standalone region that accepts drag-and-drop file interactions, rendering a clearly defined target area where users can drop files."},"380":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-1","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#installation","content":"Installation"},"381":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-2","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#examples","content":"Examples"},"382":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-3","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#default","content":"Default"},"383":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-4","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#disabled","content":"Disabled"},"384":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-5","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#file-upload","content":"File Upload"},"385":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-6","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#drop-target-label","content":"Drop Target Label"},"386":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-7","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#replace-existing-file","content":"Replace Existing File"},"387":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-8","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"388":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-9","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Keyboard"},"389":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-10","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"Screen readers"},"390":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-11","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"391":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-12","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#props","content":"Props"},"392":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-13","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#default","content":"A minimal drop zone. The `onDrop` callback receives the dropped items; use the exported `isFileDropItem` guard to narrow them to files. Wrap the instructional text in `<Text slot=\"label\">` so it labels the visually hidden drop button for screen readers."},"393":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-14","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#disabled","content":"Set `isDisabled` to prevent the drop zone from accepting interactions. The zone is dimmed and the cursor indicates it is not interactive."},"394":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-15","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#file-upload","content":"A reference composition combining `DropZone` with `FileTrigger` to support both click-to-browse and drag-and-drop. Use this as a starting point and adapt the accepted formats, size limit, and handlers to your product's requirements."},"395":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-16","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#drop-target-label","content":"Pass a render-prop function as `children` to change the zone's content while a valid drag is active. Branching on `isDropTarget` requires no extra state. Pair it with `getDropOperation` to reject unsupported types - the label only appears when the drag is accepted."},"396":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-17","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#replace-existing-file","content":"Use `children` as a render function to show different content based on the current zone state - here, swapping the default label for \"Drop to replace\" when a file is already selected and a new drag is active. The same `onDrop` handler services both the drag path and the `FileTrigger` click path, so either gesture replaces the selection."},"397":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-18","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Key"},"398":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-19","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Description"},"399":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-20","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"`Tab`"},"400":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-21","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Moves focus to the drop zone"},"401":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-22","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"`Enter` / `Space`"},"402":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-23","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Opens the file picker so files can be selected without a pointer"},"403":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-24","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"The drop zone renders a visually hidden `<button>` inside the container. Assistive technology discovers and announces this button as an interactive element — activating it opens the native file picker without a pointer."},"404":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-25","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"The button's accessible name is built from two sources, combined in order:"},"405":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-26","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"**`<Text slot=\"label\">`** — any `Text` child with `slot=\"label\"` has its `id` linked to the button via `aria-labelledby`. This is the recommended way to provide a contextual label that is also visible to sighted users."},"406":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-27","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"**`aria-label`** — pass `aria-label` on the `DropZone` component to override or supplement the label (e.g. `aria-label=\"Upload profile photo\"`). When no `Text slot=\"label\"` is present and no `aria-label` is set, the button falls back to the default \"DropZone\" label provided by React Aria."},"407":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-28","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Use the drop zone alongside a button-based file picker — drag-and-drop is a convenience, never the only way to upload."},"408":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-29","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Replace the default text with `children` to communicate the accepted file types and size limits up front."},"409":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-30","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Let the drop zone fill its container; constrain it with the surrounding layout rather than setting a fixed width on the component itself."},"410":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-31","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Reflect upload state (validating, uploading, error) outside the drop zone so the target area stays clear and predictable."},"411":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"page","content":"Drawer","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer"},"412":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-0","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer","content":"An overlay panel that slides in from a screen edge, supporting sidebar navigation and bottom sheets."},"413":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-1","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#installation","content":"Installation"},"414":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-2","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#examples","content":"Examples"},"415":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-3","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#default","content":"Default"},"416":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-4","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#bottom-sheet","content":"Bottom Sheet"},"417":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-5","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#placements","content":"Placements"},"418":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-6","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#nested-popover","content":"Nested Popover"},"419":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-7","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#no-escape-dismiss","content":"No Escape Dismiss"},"420":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-8","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#scrollable-content","content":"Scrollable content"},"421":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-9","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"422":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-10","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Keyboard"},"423":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-11","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#aria","content":"ARIA"},"424":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-12","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"425":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-13","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#props","content":"Props"},"426":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-14","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer","content":"An overlay panel that slides in from a screen edge. Built on the same RAC stack as `Modal` (a\nmodal overlay with an `elevation=\"overlay\"` panel and CSS transitions), it supports sidebar\nnavigation and bottom sheets."},"427":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-15","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer","content":"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."},"428":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-16","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#default","content":"Use `<DrawerTrigger>` to wrap a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`. The drawer opens when the trigger is pressed."},"429":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-17","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#bottom-sheet","content":"Use `placement=\"bottom\"` with controlled state for a bottom sheet pattern. Compose a\n`CloseButton` for the dismiss affordance."},"430":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-18","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#placements","content":"The drawer slides in from whichever edge you set with `placement`."},"431":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-19","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#nested-popover","content":"Popovers rendered inside a drawer stay open without dismissing the drawer."},"432":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-20","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#no-escape-dismiss","content":"Use `isKeyboardDismissDisabled` to prevent the drawer from being dismissed by the escape key."},"433":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-21","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#scrollable-content","content":"When the content is taller than the drawer, the `Content` region scrolls while the title row\nstays pinned."},"434":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-22","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Key"},"435":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-23","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Action"},"436":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-24","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"`Escape`"},"437":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-25","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Close the drawer (unless `isKeyboardDismissDisabled`)"},"438":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-26","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"`Tab`"},"439":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-27","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Move focus within the drawer (focus is trapped)"},"440":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-28","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#aria","content":"`role=\"dialog\"` with `aria-modal=\"true\"` on the drawer panel (via RAC Modal)"},"441":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-29","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#aria","content":"A `Heading slot=\"title\"` labels the dialog via `aria-labelledby`; otherwise pass `aria-label`"},"442":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-30","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#best-practices","content":"Provide a `Heading slot=\"title\"` or an `aria-label` so the dialog has an accessible name."},"443":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-31","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#best-practices","content":"Use `isDismissable` to allow closing via backdrop click."},"444":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-32","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#best-practices","content":"Don't nest drawers."},"445":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-33","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#props","content":"The `Drawer` component accepts the following props:"},"446":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-34","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#props","content":"The `DrawerTrigger` component accepts the following props:"},"447":{"id":"/docs/components/field","page_id":"/docs/components/field","type":"page","content":"Field primitives","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field"},"448":{"id":"/docs/components/field-0","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"Composable primitives (Field, FieldLabel, FieldGroup, FieldError) for building form fields"},"449":{"id":"/docs/components/field-1","page_id":"/docs/components/field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field#usage","content":"Usage"},"450":{"id":"/docs/components/field-2","page_id":"/docs/components/field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field#composition","content":"Composition"},"451":{"id":"/docs/components/field-3","page_id":"/docs/components/field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field#positioning-controls-inside-the-group","content":"Positioning controls inside the group"},"452":{"id":"/docs/components/field-4","page_id":"/docs/components/field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field#states","content":"States"},"453":{"id":"/docs/components/field-5","page_id":"/docs/components/field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field#examples","content":"Examples"},"454":{"id":"/docs/components/field-6","page_id":"/docs/components/field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field#default","content":"Default"},"455":{"id":"/docs/components/field-7","page_id":"/docs/components/field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field#leading-control","content":"Leading control"},"456":{"id":"/docs/components/field-8","page_id":"/docs/components/field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field#trailing-control","content":"Trailing control"},"457":{"id":"/docs/components/field-9","page_id":"/docs/components/field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field#icon-accessories","content":"Icon accessories"},"458":{"id":"/docs/components/field-10","page_id":"/docs/components/field","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field#props","content":"Props"},"459":{"id":"/docs/components/field-11","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"**Composition primitives.** The field components (TextField, NumberField, DateField, Select, RadioGroup, CheckboxGroup) compose these internally — reach for those first. These primitives are also the building blocks for custom composite fields, e.g. an input and a select sharing one bordered box."},"460":{"id":"/docs/components/field-12","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"The field decoration is split into granular, composable pieces so the same structure is shared across every field:"},"461":{"id":"/docs/components/field-13","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"**`Field`** — stacks a field's label, control, description, and error in one consistently spaced column (pure layout — a `Flex` column with the standard field gap)."},"462":{"id":"/docs/components/field-14","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"**`FieldLabel`** — names the field and flags whether it's required (wraps React Aria `Label`, rendering an optional `*` indicator)."},"463":{"id":"/docs/components/field-15","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"**`FieldGroup`** — the bordered box that visually unites a field's controls and reflects their shared focus, disabled, and invalid state. Used only by \"boxed\" fields (TextField, NumberField, Select, DateField); presentationally it is a React Aria `Group`."},"464":{"id":"/docs/components/field-16","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"**`FieldInput`** — the single-line control the user types into (a normalized React Aria `Input` given antares spacing via `Box`)."},"465":{"id":"/docs/components/field-17","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"**`FieldTextArea`** — the multiline control the user types into (a normalized React Aria `TextArea` given antares spacing via `Box`)."},"466":{"id":"/docs/components/field-18","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"**`FieldButton`** — an actionable control placed inside the box, such as the NumberField steppers or a search submit (a click target within the group)."},"467":{"id":"/docs/components/field-19","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"**`FieldTrigger`** — a full-width value-display button inside the box that opens an overlay (used by Select and DatePicker): a value area plus a trailing icon, laid out across the group. `variant=\"select\"` is transparent and input-like; `variant=\"control\"` is a filled segment inside a shared group."},"468":{"id":"/docs/components/field-20","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"**`FieldDescription`** — helper text that explains the field; renders nothing when empty (wraps the antares `Text` with `slot=\"description\"`)."},"469":{"id":"/docs/components/field-21","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"**`FieldError`** — surfaces the field's validation messages when it is invalid, and nothing when valid (a thin wrapper over React Aria `FieldError`)."},"470":{"id":"/docs/components/field-22","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field","content":"`FieldLabel`, `FieldDescription`, and `FieldError` each render `null` when they have no content, so callers pass `label` / `description` / `errorMessage` straight through without guarding."},"471":{"id":"/docs/components/field-23","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#composition","content":"A boxed field composes the primitives inside its React Aria field wrapper. Use\n`Field as={...}` to merge the field wrapper and the layout column into a single\nelement:"},"472":{"id":"/docs/components/field-24","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#composition","content":"A field without a box (RadioGroup / CheckboxGroup) composes `Field` + `FieldLabel` + `FieldError` and omits `FieldGroup`."},"473":{"id":"/docs/components/field-25","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#composition","content":"`FieldGroup` is purely presentational — it renders the styled `Group` and holds no React Aria context. The surrounding field wires value, disabled, and validation state into its controls."},"474":{"id":"/docs/components/field-26","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#positioning-controls-inside-the-group","content":"`FieldGroup` rounds its outer corners from DOM order: the group's CSS rounds the start corners of its **first child** and the end corners of its **last child**, so controls are seamless inside and rounded only at the box edges. Author children in visual order and the rounding follows — no per-control positioning prop. A lone control (a TextField input, a Select trigger) is both first and last, so it rounds both edges. The rules are RTL-safe (they use logical `start`/`end` corners)."},"475":{"id":"/docs/components/field-27","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#states","content":"The states **disabled**, **readonly**, and **invalid** are applied by the field wrapper (e.g. TextField, NumberField, Select). The group reflects them via data attributes on the group."},"476":{"id":"/docs/components/field-28","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#states","content":"State"},"477":{"id":"/docs/components/field-29","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#states","content":"CSS Selector"},"478":{"id":"/docs/components/field-30","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#states","content":"disabled — Applied when the field wrapper is disabled."},"479":{"id":"/docs/components/field-31","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#states","content":"`[data-disabled]`"},"480":{"id":"/docs/components/field-32","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#states","content":"invalid — Applied when the field wrapper is invalid (e.g. validation failed)."},"481":{"id":"/docs/components/field-33","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#states","content":"`[data-invalid]`"},"482":{"id":"/docs/components/field-34","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#states","content":"focus — Whether an element within the group has keyboard focus (for focus-ring styling)."},"483":{"id":"/docs/components/field-35","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#states","content":"`[data-focused]`"},"484":{"id":"/docs/components/field-36","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#default","content":"Composes the presentational field primitives (Field, FieldLabel, FieldGroup,\nFieldDescription) into a minimal boxed field, showing how the group and its\nposition markers are assembled. The fill is a static placeholder - real value,\nfocus, and validation behavior is wired up by the field components (TextField,\nNumberField, Select)."},"485":{"id":"/docs/components/field-37","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#leading-control","content":"A field group with a leading control before the input area."},"486":{"id":"/docs/components/field-38","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#trailing-control","content":"A field group with an input and a trailing action control."},"487":{"id":"/docs/components/field-39","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#icon-accessories","content":"A field group with leading icon and trailing action accessories."},"488":{"id":"/docs/components/field-40","page_id":"/docs/components/field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field#props","content":"The `FieldGroup` component has the following props:"},"489":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"page","content":"FileTrigger","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger"},"490":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-0","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger","content":"A style-less primitive that wraps any pressable component and opens the native file picker when it is activated."},"491":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-1","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#features","content":"Features"},"492":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-2","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#installation","content":"Installation"},"493":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-3","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#examples","content":"Examples"},"494":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-4","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#default","content":"Default"},"495":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-5","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#accepted-types","content":"Accepted Types"},"496":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-6","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"497":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-7","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"498":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-8","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#props","content":"Props"},"499":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-9","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#features","content":"Turns any pressable component (such as an Antares `Button`) into a file picker trigger."},"500":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-10","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#features","content":"Renders a visually hidden `<input type=\"file\">` — no styling of its own."},"501":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-11","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#features","content":"Restricts selection by MIME type, allows multiple files, directory selection, and camera capture."},"502":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-12","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#features","content":"Resets the input value before every open, so re-selecting the same file still fires `onSelect`."},"503":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-13","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#default","content":"Wrap any pressable component. Activating the child opens the native file picker; the selected files arrive in `onSelect`."},"504":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-14","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#accepted-types","content":"Restrict the picker to specific MIME types with `acceptedFileTypes`, and allow more than one file with `allowsMultiple`."},"505":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-15","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#accessibility","content":"`FileTrigger` adds no visuals or ARIA of its own — accessibility comes from the pressable child you provide. Use a component with an accessible name (e.g. an Antares `Button` with clear label text) so assistive technology announces the action. The underlying `<input>` is visually hidden but remains operable by keyboard through the child's press behavior."},"506":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-16","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."},"507":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-17","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"Pair `FileTrigger` with `DropZone` to offer both click-to-browse and drag-and-drop. See the DropZone \"File Upload\" example."},"508":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-18","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"Keep the child a single pressable element; `FileTrigger` forwards press behavior to whatever you nest inside it."},"509":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","type":"page","content":"InlineDrawer","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer"},"510":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-0","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","content":"An in-flow collapsible built on RAC Disclosure. Compose a trigger and content to make an accordion or a sidebar rail."},"511":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-1","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#features","content":"Features"},"512":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-2","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#installation","content":"Installation"},"513":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-3","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#examples","content":"Examples"},"514":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-4","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#default","content":"Default"},"515":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-5","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/inline-drawer#controlled","content":"Controlled"},"516":{"id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer-6","page_id":"/docs/components/inline-drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url"