**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"},"668":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-107","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"},"669":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-108","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"},"670":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-109","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Trade-offs:**"},"671":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-110","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"},"672":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-111","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#sprite-mode-optimization","content":"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"},"673":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-112","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#recommendations","content":"**Use default mode** for SSR applications or when icons appear infrequently"},"674":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-113","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#recommendations","content":"**Use sprite mode** when the same icons appear many times (navigation, lists, tables)"},"675":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-114","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon#recommendations","content":"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"},"676":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-115","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","u